  {
    "row": 213,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "VRRCKarlsJournalNOTE",
    "en": "This journal consists of detailed records and observations from Karl's time with the Great Khans. Many of the entries go into great detail about his opinion of their \"savage, barbarous customs,\" and at several points he waxes philosophic about how it's very likely that Caesar's Legion will have to execute the lot of them."
